{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39764","headline":"和吴学士对春雪献韦令公次韵 · 黄滔","name":"和吴学士对春雪献韦令公次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春雪下盈空，翻疑腊未穷。\n连天宁认月，堕地屡兼风。\n忽误边沙上，应平火岭中。\n林间妨走兽，云际落飞鸿。\n梁苑还吟客，齐都省创宫。\n掩扉皆墐北，移律愧居东。\n书幌飘全湿，茶铛入旋融。\n奔川半留滞，叠树互玲珑。\n出户行瑶砌，开园见粉丛。\n高才兴咏处，真宰荅殊功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}